              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nciceeco bwiime bwawo ncibwakalampila kwiinda misamu yoonse yamusokwe. Mateu aawo akavula, amitabi yawo yakalampa, nkaambo kamaanzi manji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayuni boonse bakujulu bakayaka ziteente zyabo mumitabi yawo, akunsi lyamateu aawo banyama boonse baansi mpobakazyalila. Muceenzule cawo moyakakede misyobo mipati yoonse yabantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabotesya mubwiime bwawo amubulamfu bwamitabi yawo, nkaambo miyanda yawo yakanjila mumaanzi manji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Matl 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misamu yakedari yamumuunda wa-Leza teeyakakonzya kuuinda, ayalo misamu yakupresi teeyakeelene amitabi yawo. Misigili yakali cintu buyo kumateu aawo. Taakwe musamu nuuba omwe mumuunda wa-Leza iwakeelene awo mubweebesi bwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
