        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Mubuzuba obo nuuselukila mucikalilo cabafu, njoocita kuti muninga wamaanzi ulile. Njoolesya tulonga twawo, amaanzi manji ayoosinkwa. Njoosizya Lebano nkaambo kanguwo, amisamu yoonse yamusokwe iyoopusama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
