                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyamvwigwa buyo ijwi lyabuwe bwawo, njookankamya bamasi, nenzoouwaala mucikalilo cabafu antoomwe abaabo baselukila mucilindi. Lino misamu yoonse ya-Edeni, misamu mibotu iiyandika yaku-Lebano, yoonse buyo iinywa maanzi, iyooumuzigwa nkukonya oko kunyika yakwacimvumwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
