                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoonse buyo iyooseluka antoomwe anguwo mucikalilo cabafu, nkobabede bantu ibakajazigwa ipanga. Boonse buyo ibakakede mucenzule cawo akati kabamasi bayoonyonyooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
