        },
        {
          "text": "Ma! Nguni ngoelene awe mubulemu bwako amubupati bwako? Nguni ngoelene awe akati kamisamu ya-Edeni? Uyooselusigwa munyika yakwacimvumwe antoomwe amisamu yamusokwe. Uyoolala akati kabatapalwidwe bajazigwa ipanga. Mbwabede Farao, amakamu oonse aabantu bakwe, mbwaamba Mwami Jehova.",
